Package: sysible-artwork
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sysible Linux wallpapers and branding
 The finalized Sysible Linux wallpaper set (Mesh, Fleet, Contour, and Aurora in
 dark and light, plus the SysTerm-centered Beacon and Hub) at 3840x2160, installed
 under /usr/share/backgrounds/sysible and registered with the GNOME background
 chooser. sysible-desktop-gnome sets Mesh (Dark) as the default.
